  "notes": "VERB TYPE:\n⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive verb)\n\nGodan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}) ending in る\n- {怖|こわ}がらない (negative)\n- {怖|こわ}がって (te-form)\n- {怖|こわ}がった (past)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\nThis is the -⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ form of the i-adjective ⟦{怖|こわ}い→怖い：00864_kowai⟧. The -⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ suffix converts adjectives describing internal feelings into verbs that describe observable behavior.\n\n⟦{怖|こわ}い→怖い：00864_kowai⟧ vs {怖|こわ}がる:\n- ⟦{怖|こわ}い→怖い：00864_kowai⟧ - (I am) scared, frightening\n- {怖|こわ}がる - to be afraid of, to show fear (observed behavior)\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{怖|こわ}がる - to be afraid of ~\n- {怖|こわ}がらせる - to frighten, to scare (causative)\n- {怖|こわ}がり - a scaredy-cat, timid person (noun form)\n\nRELATED -がる VERBS:\n- {欲|ほ}し⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ - to want (from ⟦{欲|ほ}しい→欲しい：01107_hoshii⟧)\n- {恥|は}ずかし⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ - to be shy (from ⟦{恥|は}ずかしい→恥ずかしい：00843_hazukashii⟧)\n- {寂|さび}し⟦がる→〜がる：03089_garu⟧ - to feel lonely (from ⟦{寂|さび}しい→寂しい：00880_sabishii⟧)",
